   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Koordinat düzleminde P(a − 3, 2a + 1) noktası y ekseni üzerinde, Q(b + 2, b − 4) noktası x ekseni üzerindedir. O başlangıç noktası olmak üzere OPQ üçgeni aşağıda taralı olarak gösterilmiştir.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 282\" width=\"360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Koordinat düzleminde y ekseni üzerindeki P noktası, x ekseni üzerindeki Q noktası ve başlangıç noktası O ile oluşan taralı OPQ üçgeni\"><polygon points=\"70,248 70,66 226,248\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"338,248 330,244 330,252\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"276\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"70,24 66,32 74,32\" fill=\"#334155\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-style=\"italic\">x</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-style=\"italic\">y</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">O</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"66\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#b45309\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"226\" cy=\"248\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#b45309\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">P(a − 3, 2a + 1)</text><text x=\"226\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Q(b + 2, b − 4)</text></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre OPQ üçgeninin alanı kaç birimkaredir?</b></p>",
