   "q": "<p>Bir okulun konferans salonundaki sıraların her birinde eşit sayıda koltuk vardır. 8. sınıf öğrencileri bu salona yerleştirilecektir.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 180\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Her sırada eşit sayıda koltuk bulunan konferans salonunun sıraları\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"560\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"50\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"50\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"50\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"50\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"50\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"50\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"50\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"360\" y=\"50\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"76\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"76\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"76\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"76\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"76\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"76\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"76\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"360\" y=\"76\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"102\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"102\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"102\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"102\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"102\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"102\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"102\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"360\" y=\"102\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"128\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"128\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"128\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"128\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"128\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"128\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"128\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"360\" y=\"128\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"18\" width=\"232\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"266\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Sahne</text><text x=\"266\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">…</text></svg></div><ul><li>Her sıraya 6 öğrenci oturtulursa bütün sıralar dolmakta ve 8 öğrenci ayakta kalmaktadır.</li><li>Her sıraya 8 öğrenci oturtulursa 2 sıra tamamen boş kalmakta, diğer sıralar ise tam dolmaktadır.</li></ul><p><b>Buna göre salona yerleştirilecek 8. sınıf öğrencisi sayısı kaçtır?</b></p>",
