   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>A: 0’dan yukarı, 12. s’de 24 m.</li> <li>B: 60 m’den aşağı, 12. s’de 24 m.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>B yere indiğinde A’nın yüksekliği.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Hızlar</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">A: 24 ÷ 12 = 2 m/s</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">B: (60 − 24) ÷ 12 = 3 m/s</span></li> <li><b>B’nin iniş süresi</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">60 ÷ 3 = 20 s</span></li> <li><b>A’nın yüksekliği</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">20 · 2 = 40 m</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 280\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"B 20. saniyede yere iner; o anda A 40 m’dedir.\"><line x1=\"46.0\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"394.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"400.0,240.0 392.0,236.0 392.0,244.0\" fill=\"#334155\"/><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"244.0\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"16.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"50.0,10.0 46.0,18.0 54.0,18.0\" fill=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"392.0\" y=\"270.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Zaman (s)</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"13.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Yükseklik (m)</text><text x=\"42.0\" y=\"255.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">O</text><line x1=\"230.0\" y1=\"237.0\" x2=\"230.0\" y2=\"243.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"230.0\" y=\"256.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">12</text><line x1=\"350.0\" y1=\"237.0\" x2=\"350.0\" y2=\"243.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"350.0\" y=\"256.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">20</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"163.6\" x2=\"53.0\" y2=\"163.6\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"167.6\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">24</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"112.7\" x2=\"53.0\" y2=\"112.7\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"116.7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">40</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"49.1\" x2=\"53.0\" y2=\"49.1\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"53.1\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">60</text><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"380.0\" y2=\"100.0\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"49.1\" x2=\"350.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/><line x1=\"230.0\" y1=\"163.6\" x2=\"230.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"230.0\" y1=\"163.6\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"163.6\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"350.0\" y1=\"112.7\" x2=\"350.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"350.0\" y1=\"112.7\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"112.7\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"350.0\" cy=\"112.7\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><circle cx=\"350.0\" cy=\"240.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><text x=\"365.0\" y=\"87.3\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">A</text><text x=\"80.0\" y=\"55.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">B</text></svg><figcaption>B 20. saniyede yere iner; o anda A 40 m’dedir.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Doğrusal hareket grafiğinde hız = eğim; iki noktadan hızı bul, sonra istenen ana uzat.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Kesişimdeki 24 m’yi kullanıp 48 (D) ya da B’nin 12 saniyede indiği 36 m’yi (A) yazmak yanlıştır.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
