   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>A: 600 L’den azalıyor; 8. dk’da 360 L.</li> <li>B: 0’dan artıyor; 8. dk’da 360 L.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>B’de 450 L olduğunda A’daki su.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Hızlar</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">A: (600 − 360) ÷ 8 = 30 L/dk boşalır</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">B: 360 ÷ 8 = 45 L/dk dolar</span></li> <li><b>B’nin 450 L’ye ulaşma süresi</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">450 ÷ 45 = 10 dk</span></li> <li><b>A’da kalan</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">600 − 10 · 30 = 300 L</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 280\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"10. dakikada B’de 450 L, A’da 300 L su vardır.\"><line x1=\"46.0\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"394.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"400.0,240.0 392.0,236.0 392.0,244.0\" fill=\"#334155\"/><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"244.0\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"16.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"50.0,10.0 46.0,18.0 54.0,18.0\" fill=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"392.0\" y=\"270.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Zaman (dk)</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"13.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Su (L)</text><text x=\"42.0\" y=\"255.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">O</text><line x1=\"170.0\" y1=\"237.0\" x2=\"170.0\" y2=\"243.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"256.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">8</text><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"237.0\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"243.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"256.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">10</text><line x1=\"350.0\" y1=\"237.0\" x2=\"350.0\" y2=\"243.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"350.0\" y=\"256.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">20</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"144.5\" x2=\"53.0\" y2=\"144.5\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"148.5\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">300</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"125.5\" x2=\"53.0\" y2=\"125.5\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"129.5\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">360</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"96.8\" x2=\"53.0\" y2=\"96.8\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"100.8\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">450</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"49.1\" x2=\"53.0\" y2=\"49.1\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"53.1\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">600</text><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"49.1\" x2=\"350.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"245.0\" y2=\"53.9\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/><line x1=\"170.0\" y1=\"125.5\" x2=\"170.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"170.0\" y1=\"125.5\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"125.5\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"96.8\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"96.8\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"96.8\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"200.0\" cy=\"144.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><circle cx=\"200.0\" cy=\"96.8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"144.5\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"144.5\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"80.0\" y=\"39.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">A</text><text x=\"254.0\" y=\"49.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#16a34a\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">B</text></svg><figcaption>10. dakikada B’de 450 L, A’da 300 L su vardır.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Kesişim noktası “eşit oldukları an”dır; buradan iki hızı da hesaplayabilirsin.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Toplam su sabit değildir (hızlar farklı); 720 − 450 = 270 (A) yanlıştır.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
