   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Parkur 12 km.</li> <li>Elif’in kalan yolu: 12 km → 80. dk’da 0.</li> <li>Can’ın gittiği yol: 10. dk’da 0’dan başlıyor.</li> <li>Doğrular 40. dk’da kesişiyor.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Can bitirdiğinde Elif’in kalan yolu.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Elif’in hızı</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">12 ÷ 80 = 0,15 km/dk → 40. dk’da kalan 12 − 6 = 6 km</span></li> <li><b>Kesişimin anlamı</b> 40. dk’da Elif’in KALAN yolu ile Can’ın GİTTİĞİ yol eşit: Can 6 km gitmiştir.</li> <li><b>Can’ın hızı ve bitiş anı</b> Can 10. dakikada başlamış, 30 dk’da 6 km koşmuş. <span class=\"sv-m\">6 ÷ 30 = 0,2 km/dk → 12 ÷ 0,2 = 60 dk</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">bitiş: 10 + 60 = 70. dk</span></li> <li><b>Elif’in kalan yolu</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">12 − 0,15 · 70 = 12 − 10,5 = 1,5 km</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 440 280\" width=\"440\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Can 70. dakikada bitirir; o anda Elif’in 1,5 km yolu kalmıştır.\"><line x1=\"46.0\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"414.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"420.0,240.0 412.0,236.0 412.0,244.0\" fill=\"#334155\"/><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"244.0\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"16.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"50.0,10.0 46.0,18.0 54.0,18.0\" fill=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"412.0\" y=\"270.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Zaman (dk)</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"13.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Yol (km)</text><text x=\"42.0\" y=\"255.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">O</text><line x1=\"91.2\" y1=\"237.0\" x2=\"91.2\" y2=\"243.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"91.2\" y=\"256.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">10</text><line x1=\"214.7\" y1=\"237.0\" x2=\"214.7\" y2=\"243.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"214.7\" y=\"256.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">40</text><line x1=\"338.2\" y1=\"237.0\" x2=\"338.2\" y2=\"243.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"338.2\" y=\"256.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">70</text><line x1=\"379.4\" y1=\"237.0\" x2=\"379.4\" y2=\"243.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"379.4\" y=\"256.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">80</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"216.7\" x2=\"53.0\" y2=\"216.7\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"220.7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">1,5</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"146.7\" x2=\"53.0\" y2=\"146.7\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"150.7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">6</text><line x1=\"47.0\" y1=\"53.3\" x2=\"53.0\" y2=\"53.3\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"57.3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">12</text><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"53.3\" x2=\"379.4\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/><line x1=\"91.2\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"338.2\" y2=\"53.3\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/><line x1=\"214.7\" y1=\"146.7\" x2=\"214.7\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"214.7\" y1=\"146.7\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"146.7\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"338.2\" y1=\"53.3\" x2=\"338.2\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"338.2\" cy=\"216.7\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><line x1=\"338.2\" y1=\"216.7\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"216.7\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"338.2\" cy=\"53.3\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><text x=\"111.8\" y=\"65.8\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#2563eb\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Elif (kalan)</text><text x=\"321.8\" y=\"39.3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Can (gittiği)</text></svg><figcaption>Can 70. dakikada bitirir; o anda Elif’in 1,5 km yolu kalmıştır.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Grafikte iki farklı büyüklük (kalan yol ve gidilen yol) çizilmişse kesişim “aynı yerde oldukları” anlamına gelmez; sadece iki sayının eşit olduğu andır.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Can’ın 10. dakikada başladığını görmezsen hızını 6 ÷ 40 bulursun ve yanlış sonuca gidersin.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
