   "a": "A",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>d₁: y = 2x − 4</li> <li>d₂: y = −x + 5</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>d₁, d₂ ve x ekseni arasındaki bölgenin alanı.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>x eksenini kestikleri noktalar</b> y = 0 koy. <span class=\"sv-m\">d₁: x = 2, d₂: x = 5 → taban = 5 − 2 = 3</span></li> <li><b>Kesişim noktası</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">2x − 4 = −x + 5 → x = 3, y = 2</span></li> <li><b>Yükseklik</b> Taban x ekseninde olduğu için yükseklik kesişimin y’sidir. <span class=\"sv-m\">h = 2</span></li> <li><b>Alan</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">(3 · 2) ÷ 2 = 3 birimkare</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 330 230\" width=\"330\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Taban x ekseninde (2’den 5’e), tepe (3, 2).\"><line x1=\"25.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"25.0\" y2=\"25.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"65.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"65.0\" y2=\"25.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"105.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"105.0\" y2=\"25.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"145.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"25.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"185.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"185.0\" y2=\"25.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"225.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"225.0\" y2=\"25.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"265.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"265.0\" y2=\"25.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"305.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"305.0\" y2=\"25.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"25.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"305.0\" y2=\"205.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"25.0\" y1=\"169.0\" x2=\"305.0\" y2=\"169.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"25.0\" y1=\"133.0\" x2=\"305.0\" y2=\"133.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"25.0\" y1=\"97.0\" x2=\"305.0\" y2=\"97.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"25.0\" y1=\"61.0\" x2=\"305.0\" y2=\"61.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"25.0\" y1=\"25.0\" x2=\"305.0\" y2=\"25.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"145.0,169.0 265.0,169.0 185.0,97.0\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" fill-opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"21.0\" y1=\"169.0\" x2=\"319.0\" y2=\"169.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"325.0,169.0 317.0,165.0 317.0,173.0\" fill=\"#334155\"/><line x1=\"65.0\" y1=\"209.0\" x2=\"65.0\" y2=\"11.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"65.0,5.0 61.0,13.0 69.0,13.0\" fill=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"323.0\" y=\"187.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" font-style=\"italic\">x</text><text x=\"53.0\" y=\"13.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" font-style=\"italic\">y</text><text x=\"57.0\" y=\"184.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">O</text><line x1=\"145.0\" y1=\"166.0\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"172.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"145.0\" y=\"185.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">2</text><line x1=\"185.0\" y1=\"166.0\" x2=\"185.0\" y2=\"172.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"185.0\" y=\"185.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">3</text><line x1=\"265.0\" y1=\"166.0\" x2=\"265.0\" y2=\"172.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"265.0\" y=\"185.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">5</text><line x1=\"62.0\" y1=\"97.0\" x2=\"68.0\" y2=\"97.0\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"59.0\" y=\"101.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">2</text><line x1=\"125.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"225.0\" y2=\"25.0\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"237.0\" y=\"39.4\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">d₁</text><line x1=\"105.0\" y1=\"25.0\" x2=\"305.0\" y2=\"205.0\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"105.0\" y=\"39.4\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#16a34a\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">d₂</text><circle cx=\"185.0\" cy=\"97.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><text x=\"185.0\" y=\"87.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">(3, 2)</text><line x1=\"185.0\" y1=\"97.0\" x2=\"185.0\" y2=\"169.0\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"191.0\" y=\"136.6\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">h = 2</text><text x=\"205.0\" y=\"190.6\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b45309\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">taban = 3</text></svg><figcaption>Taban x ekseninde (2’den 5’e), tepe (3, 2).</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Taban x eksenindeyse yükseklik = tepe noktasının ordinatı; taban y eksenindeyse yükseklik = apsisi.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Yükseklik olarak x = 3’ü almak 4,5 (B) verir; bu üçgenin tabanı x ekseninde.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>A</b></div></div>"
